          "isClientSpecific": true,
          "provenance": {
            "assertionStatus": "Stated",
            "pageNumbers": [
              7
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Lifestyling - Your funds are currently invested in lifestyling funds, which automatically reduce investment risk as you approach retirement. As a result, your portfolio will eventually move outside of your agreed risk range. We would not recommend remaining invested in these types of funds.",
