        },
        {
          "text": "Multi-asset fund selection - Zurich does not offer risk level 5 funds, so to achieve this profile, a blend of a risk level 7 and a risk level 2 fund has been used. As there are no multi-asset funds available within your risk range, the blend consists of the Managed AP fund (in which you are already invested) and an asset-specific fund, Interest Deposits. We would not recommend investing in single asset types, as this reduces diversification, and the blended funds have not performed as well as the options available through Aviva, albeit marginally.",
