            "sectionHeading": "Inheritance Tax Summary"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "However, legislation has now been passed to change this. From 6 April 2027, most unused defined contribution pensions and death benefits (such as drawdown funds and uncrystallised pots) will be included in your taxable estate for IHT.",
          "topic": "PensionInclusionInEstate",
          "isClientSpecific": false,
          "provenance": {
            "assertionStatus": "Stated",
            "documentId": "Suitability Report Test 1.pdf",
